{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01816",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 4.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.4,
      "end_seconds": 10.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.58,
      "end_seconds": 22.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "I wanted to get chest pain after a crash looked at. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.52,
      "end_seconds": 27.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.64,
      "end_seconds": 32.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "It's been about a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.34,
      "end_seconds": 36.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Right, how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.24,
      "end_seconds": 38.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.87,
      "end_seconds": 40.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.81,
      "end_seconds": 72.1,
      "duration_seconds": 30.29,
      "text": "It usually comes with difficulty breathing. As for feeling faint, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About feeling faint, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. It happens all the time. Uh, I've also had belly pain. With belly pain, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. The difficulty breathing? That's been for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.69,
      "end_seconds": 80.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Have you had chest pain after a crash before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.55,
      "end_seconds": 87.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "A bit, a couple of years ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.37,
      "end_seconds": 91.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.5,
      "end_seconds": 107.93,
      "duration_seconds": 14.43,
      "text": "I take naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day. Ramipril. I take it 5 milligrams, every morning. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.28,
      "end_seconds": 110.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.45,
      "end_seconds": 114.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.39,
      "end_seconds": 117.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.08,
      "end_seconds": 122.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.14,
      "end_seconds": 125.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.53,
      "end_seconds": 132.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.06,
      "end_seconds": 137.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.02,
      "end_seconds": 144.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees. I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.1,
      "end_seconds": 148.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.31,
      "end_seconds": 155.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.18,
      "end_seconds": 174.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "And head injury, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.74,
      "end_seconds": 180.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any head injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.05,
      "end_seconds": 186.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "A few quick ones: neck pain or loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.46,
      "end_seconds": 190.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.35,
      "end_seconds": 194.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.3,
      "end_seconds": 198.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.31,
      "end_seconds": 206.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.05,
      "end_seconds": 221.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.75,
      "end_seconds": 245.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 99 over 56, temperature is 36.8 degrees, saturation 96 percent. And heart rate 112."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.26,
      "end_seconds": 251.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.53,
      "end_seconds": 255.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.63,
      "end_seconds": 279.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "There is bruising across the chest, the left side moves less, and the belly is tender and rigid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.34,
      "end_seconds": 287.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.58,
      "end_seconds": 310.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? I'd lean towards serious chest and abdominal injury. Another possibility is internal bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.4,
      "end_seconds": 313.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.71,
      "end_seconds": 341.54,
      "duration_seconds": 21.83,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with serious chest and abdominal injury do well once it's treated properly. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had chest pain after a crash for about a month, moderate, and no head injury or loss of consciousness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.15,
      "end_seconds": 344.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.2,
      "end_seconds": 375.12,
      "duration_seconds": 22.92,
      "text": "Let's book a trauma CT scan to look into major trauma. I'll request an urgent blood cross-match, it'll help with trauma. Do not move, I am activating the trauma team now. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.56,
      "end_seconds": 381.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.34,
      "end_seconds": 386.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.79,
      "end_seconds": 389.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.58,
      "end_seconds": 391.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}